  "body": "## Bug fixes\n- Updates install more reliably and only one install runs at a time.\n- The \"not signed in\" update error shows once instead of on every check, and someone signed in who never registered on BibleQuiz.com is told to register.\n- A question with no point value can no longer be scored by mistake.\n- Cancelling or timing out a browser sign-in no longer blocks the next attempt.\n"
